<title>UK: Abbey National sets $250 mln two-year bond. [CORRECTED 9:24 GMT]</title>
<headline>Abbey National sets $250 mln two-year bond. [CORRECTED 9:24 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Goldman Sachs International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ABBEY NATIONAL TREASURY INTERNATIONAL LTD</p>
<p>(Corrects borrower from &quot;Abbey National Treasury Services Plc&quot;)</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  ABBEY NATIONAL PLC</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	COUPON     6.0	 MATURITY    12.AUG.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.108   PAY DATE    12.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.858    SPREAD	+14 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  UK	  TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.0 PCT TWO-YEAR U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
